  "description": "CosmoNova is the unified T-SQL database engine for .NET 10: an embeddable LSM-tree storage layer (formerly CosmoKv: MVCC snapshot-isolation transactions, WAL durability, value-log indirection, background compaction) plus a T-SQL parser/planner/executor that runs the same dialect as SQL Server. One package, one assembly, free access between engine and storage.",
